    <string name="vpn_about_text">FoxHole VPN %1$s. A focused VPN client from FoxHole Team. Fonts: Tiny5 and JetBrains Mono, SIL Open Font License 1.1.</string>
    <string name="vpn_help_connect_title">Connection</string>
    <string name="vpn_help_connect_body">Import a profile from your VPN provider or your own server, select it, tap Start and allow the Android VPN request. Stop cancels a pending connection or disconnects the VPN.</string>
    <string name="vpn_help_profiles_title">Profiles</string>
    <string name="vpn_help_profiles_body">Tap a profile to choose a protocol. Long-press to share, refresh, delete or send it to a paired router. Sharing includes the full profile or its source link and may contain access credentials. Share only with people you trust. Refresh updates v2rayTun subscriptions and Outline dynamic keys.</string>
